 ],
 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูลถูกตัดออกแล้ว",
 "strings": {
  "Nothin' good e'er came from samurai huddlin' about.": "",
  "Joshi come 'round, ye be sure to make way.": "",
  "Where'd my fool of a husband run off to?": "",
  "Heard another'un went to Takechi-sensei's place.": "",
  "All the samurai are there, by now.": "",
  "Toyo-sama's a great man.": "",
  "Don't matter what they say, I know 'e is.": "",
  "Ugh. Better hurry and check in with sensei.": "",
  "Gotten well-dangerous 'round here of late.": "",
  "Yeeeah! Drinks're dem good t'day!": "",
  "Patron": "",
  "Celebratin' something?": "",
  "Yup. Caught a bundle a fishies this mornin'.": "",
  "Toppa that, joshi bought 'em all out.": "",
  "So, I been drinkin' e'er since.": "",
  "Oops! Cup's empty!": "",
  "Oi! Refill this, wouldja?": "",
  "'Right. One moment.": "",
  "Tch. Look atcha. Drunkard.": "",
  "Shut it! I've earned my drinks!": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. If ye say so.": "",
  "I swear...": "",
  "Sir. 'Ere ye are.": "",
  "Hm? This isn't what I ordered!": "",
  "Honestly... Why're ye makin' mistakes like this?": "",
  "No. It's because I was rude to ye earlier.": "",
  "Hope this makes up for it.": "",
  "Oh. That's decent of ye.": "",
  "Next time, bring me a good catcha fish.": "",
  "Haha, sure thing.": "",
  "I'll bring ye one this big, swear it!": "",
  "Lookin' forward to that.": "",
  "Hmph!": "",
  "Hm? Somethin' wrong?": "",
  "Nah. Nothin'.": "",
  "Just that... Ye live life knowin' yer proper place, an' all...": "",
  "An' at least in Tosa, ye can still 'ave a good drink.": "",
  "Spoken true.": "",
  "Kagami's nice an' calm today.": "",
  "Ye said it. Beautiful.": "",
  "By the way...": "",
  "Know why they call it Kagami?": "",
  "No. Can't say as I do.": "",
  "If ye head further down, it's said...": "",
  "The water in it starts reflectin' the sky like a mirror.\nHence, Kagami, the word for \"mirror.\"": "",
  "When the fifth lord, Yamauchi Toyofusa-sama,\nsaw it, he said:": "",
  "\"It's like a mirror which reflects my very shadow.\"": "",
  "From then on, it's been known as Kagami River.": "",
  "'Ey. Ye know your stuff.": "",
  "So, what was it called afore that?\n'Fore it was dubbed Kagami?": "",
  "Eh? Uh... Um... What was it again?": "",
  "Heh. Don't know that one, eh?": "",
  "Hahaha. Afraid not.": "",
  "It's lively around here.": "",
  "Makes sense, this being the Imperial Court's backyard.": "",
  "That's true.": "",
  "The kimono in this city are gorgeous. I'm so envious.": "",
  "Haha. I'm sure we could at least get you a hair ornament.": "",
  "Really? You sure?": "",
  "Yeah. We'll look for some later.": "",
  "So. Where should we go now?": "",
  "I'd like to get something to eat first.": "",
  "Let's ask around. See what's good in the area.": "",
  "That's a plan.": "",
  "Say, with everything that's happened lately...": "",
  "Maybe it's time we went back home.": "",
  "You're right. It's gotten more dangerous here.": "",
  "If things get much worse, who knows if we'll even be able to leave.": "",
  "Ah. All right, it's settled. We'll go tomorrow.": "",
  "Thanks. I'll start packing.": "",
  "Man. This place is amazing.": "",
  "Kyo, I mean.": "",
  "You said it. Feels like I've barely scratched the surface.": "",
  "Seriously. I could walk around all day.": "",
  "Well, let's do it. How about there next?": "",
  "Sure!": "",
  "Good ta see ya, miss. Been too long.": "",
  "Sure has been!": "",
  "Ya out shopping?": "",
  "Yep. Ya can find everythin' in this part of town. Very convenient.": "",
  "Precisely. My family comes here a lot too.": "",
  "Till next time!": "",
  "I'm so glad ta be out with ya again like this.": "",
  "I'm jus' so dang happy.": "",
  "Yeah? That's nice of ya.": "",
  "Let's go a bit further this time?": "",
  "Uh, sure.": "",
  "Heh heh, don't booze taste great?": "",
  "Ayup. Nothin' beats a drink after work.": "",
  "It's whatcha need ta give it yer all the next day!": "",
  "Haha! Yer right about that!": "",
  "Oi, girl, where's my order?": "",
  "Oh, comin' right up.": "",
  "Ya sure 'bout that?": "",
  "Man! The parlor girl? Impressive work!": "",
  "Eh... No big deal.": "",
  "Haha, well, better than I could pull. Drink up!": "",
  "Thanks for the delicious food today!": "",
  "Ho ho, thank you for your patronage!": "",
  "S'pposed to be a good restaurant 'round here.": "",
  "Where is it, then?": "",
  "Hey. Ask that guy, won'tcha?": "",
  "Ah. Sure.": "",
  "Um, 'scuse me.": "",
  "I heard there's a restaurant nearby that we shouldn't miss. Do ya know it?": "",
  "Um... Jus' 'round that corner there, I think?": "",
  "Oh. Well, much obliged! Thanks!": "",
  "The okami's a friend a mine.": "",
  "Give her my regards, would ya?": "",
  "Always somethin' new 'round here.": "",
  "Wonder when it's ever gonna end.": "",
  "Yer too right...": "",
  "They make real good zenzai there.": "",
  "Up fer it? I love dessert.": "",
  "Ya really wanna? We just had manju.": "",
  "Oh, okay. Some other time, then.": "",
  "Couldn't win it back, damn it.": "",
  "Gambling Den Customer": "",
  "Yer never gonna win bettin' like you do.": "",
  "I'm gettin' rich today!": "",
  "Me too!": "",
  "Sheesh! Too close!": "",
  "It's bad luck ta sit next ta someone so deep'n the hole.": "",
  "Yeah. Oh well, least I won.": "",
  "Wonder if that guy was gettin' cheated.": "",
  "No way, they wouldn't.": "",
  "Yeah, but... Watchin' someone lose like he did, hard to believe.": "",
  "It ain't over fer me! Not by a long shot!": "",
  "One big hit, that's all I need ta get out!": "",
  "Why's that so much ta ask fer?": "",
  "Dammit. Things're never gonna go my way.": "",
  "Say, what brings you out here?": "",
  "Mukurogai Resident": "",
  "Look. Even if I wanted ta work, my arm's outta commission.": "",
  "How 'bout you?": "",
  "Got cheated. Outta money, inta debt.": "",
  "Tried makin' it back gambling...": "",
  "No good. No good at all.": "",
  "Is that so...": "",
  "I'm gettin' used to it here now.": "",
  "Too scared to go back, anyhow.": "",
  "Aw, I'm outta booze.": "",
  "I got a bit left. Want some?": "",
  "Y-You sure? If yer offerin', yeah.": "",
  "Wonder 'bout my wife 'n' kids.": "",
  "Wonder... are they even alive?": "",
  "Still, though. Can't leave this place ta check.": "",
  "Hey. Be glad ya even hadda family. Still might have people out there.": "",
  "All I got left is gamblin'.": "",
  "Another goddamn loss.": "",
  "How long can I keep losin fer'!?": "",
  "Heh heh. I can finally get out.": "",
  "Maybe I'll even find a girl ta marry.": "",
  "And then another one. I'll marry so many girls!": "",
  "He talkin' in his sleep again?": "",
  "Aw well. At least he's havin' nice dreams.": "",
  "Good point.": "",
  "M-Money...": "",
  "It won't jus' cover my losses...": "",
  "With all this money, I could make a fresh start.": "",
  "This again, huh?": "",
  "Y'know, you sound pretty similar in yer sleep.": "",
  "Fer real?": "",
  "Heh. Guess we're all the same.": "",
  "Well, why not turn in, then?": "",
  "Hey, ain't that Shinsengumi?": "",
  "Shit. Jus' awful.": "",
  "Hey now.": "",
  "Don't say that too loud.": "",
  "Yer right. Let's keep movin'.": "",
  "Do they really think they're cool in those big flashy haori?": "",
  "Heh heh, really.": "",
  "Those Mibu Wolves are all killers.": "",
  "Nothin' good comes from gettin' involved.": "",
  "Another soul fer the Buddha.": "",
  "How awful.": "",
  "The Shinsengumi're behind it, bet.": "",
  "Don't they just look like villains?": "",
  "I saw some people in blue haori murder a man yesterday.": "",
  "Heard it was 'cause they tried to leave the store without payin'.": "",
  "That's terrifying.": "",
  "They don't even help out when we're in trouble.": "",
  "They're useless.": "",
  "And they're s'pposed ta keep the peace?": "",
  "See that samurai jus' now?": "",
  "I did. He's a handsome one.": "",
  "Where's he from, ya think?": "",
  "Dunno. I heard him sing the other night, though. He was amazin'.": "",
  "Other night some creeps surrounded me and a samurai came ta my rescue.": "",
  "Shinsengumi, too. Guess they actually do some good.": "",
  "Wow. That's unusual.": "",
  "Maybe the Wolves have one or two good apples.": "",
  "Hope I meet one someday.": "",
  "I saw 'em helpin' out over the smallest thing, the other day.": "",
  "That so? Maybe the Shinsengumi's gotten better lately?": "",
  "Say, ya seen that Shinsengumi guy around before?": "",
  "Yeah. I recognize him, I think.": "",
  "Right? Feels like I see him all over the place lately.": "",
  "Hm. All right.": "",
  "Huh? Ya don't think he's hot?": "",
  "These scary folk were harassin' me recently. It was awful.": "",
  "Wow. Still, at least men still want to harass you.": "",
  "Ugh, thanks for the sympathy.": "",
  "Leaving that aside...": "",
  "Ha, alright, what happened next?": "",
  "Then this guy came.": "",
  "This samurai sent them all runnin'.": "",
  "Jus' showed up and chased 'em off.": "",
  "He had cold, dead eyes when he did it. It was kinda scary.": "",
  "But, he was handsome.": "",
  "Oh, that musta been Saito-san, I figure.": "",
  "Shinsengumi haori?": "",
  "Um, yeah. You know him?": "",
  "Mm. He's a regular at our place.": "",
  "That's great that Saito-san helped you!": "",
  "You should ask him for a drink next time.": "",
  "Oi, ain't that a Shinsengumi man?": "",
  "Yeah. Not jus' anyone, the Third Division Captain.": "",
  "Wow. How're you so in-the-know?": "",
  "I'm not. He's just famous 'round here.": "",
  "Hm? Isn't that...?": "",
  "What, you know a Shinsengumi trooper all the sudden?": "",
  "'Course not. But that one...": "",
  "He's pretty skilled.": "",
  "Haven't seen ya lately.": "",
  "Ya doin' okay?": "",
  "Ah, sorry fer that.": "",
  "Been to Nagasaki 'n' back.": "",
  "Nagasaki? What fer?": "",
  "Doin' trade.": "",
  "Britain, France... Others too, I reckon.": "",
  "That mean yer gonna keep goin'?": "",
  "Shit, I'm gonna miss ya.": "",
  "Haw! Don't say that!": "",
  "Hair ornaments? They're beautiful.": "",
  "What... is this?": "",
  "A fan from overseas.": "",
  "See? Check it out.": "",
  "Wow. It's so pretty.": "",
  "So, I'll be back all the time with more souvenirs. No need ta worry.": "",
  "Sure ya don't need a palanquin?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm walkin' today.": "",
  "When will you be back?": "",
  "Hm. I'm in town a bit longer. I'll drop by again.": "",
  "Okay! I'll be waitin'!": "",
  "Good. See ya.": "",
  "Fine lady, that one.": "",
  "Yup. Damn beauty.": "",
  "Ugh, how distractin'.": "",
  "She's so fair.": ""
 }
}